 frac{3sqrt{2}}{sqrt{6}+sqrt{3}} - frac{4sqrt{3}}{sqrt{6}+sqrt{2}} + frac{sqrt{6}}{sqrt{3}+sqrt{2}} 

**Formula Used:**

 (a)/(sqrt{x)+sqrt{y}} = frac{a(sqrt{x}-sqrt{y})}{x-y} 

**Calculation:**

⇒ frac{3sqrt{2}(sqrt{6}-sqrt{3})}{6-3} - frac{4sqrt{3}(sqrt{6}-sqrt{2})}{6-2} + frac{sqrt{6}(sqrt{3}-sqrt{2})}{3-2} &l
